23, 26);\">Ordinary Bill:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Any regular proposed law (e.g., education, policing, health) that is <em class=\"zhvwWe\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"LFsGHb#ycPkjf\" data-sfc-root=\"c\" jsuid=\"eweHjf_w\" data-complete=\"true\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);\">not<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> about taxes/budgets (Money Bill) or changing the Constitution.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><span></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li class=\"Z1qcYe\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"oSLmPe#HokZ0d\" data-sfc-root=\"c\" jsuid=\"eweHjf_12\" data-hveid=\"CAIIBxAE\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sae=\"\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"KdQfFc#d5Qebf\" data-sfc-root=\"c\" jsuid=\"eweHjf_13\" data-complete=\"true\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"tP2kf#s32ZS\" data-sfc-root=\"c\" jsuid=\"eweHjf_14\" data-complete=\"true\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);\">Vidhan Sabha vs. Vidhan Parishad (State Level):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> The directly elected <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"tP2kf#s32ZS\" data-sfc-root=\"c\" jsuid=\"eweHjf_15\" data-complete=\"true\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);\">Assembly (Sabha)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> holds all the real power; the indirectly elected <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"tP2kf#s32ZS\" data-sfc-root=\"c\" jsuid=\"eweHjf_16\" data-complete=\"true\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);\">Council (Parishad)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> is weak and can only delay an ordinary bill for <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"tP2kf#s32ZS\" data-sfc-root=\"c\" jsuid=\"eweHjf_17\" data-complete=\"true\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);\">4 months<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> (3 months + 1 month).<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><span></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li class=\"Z1qcYe\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"oSLmPe#HokZ0d\" data-sfc-root=\"c\" jsuid=\"eweHjf_1d\" data-hveid=\"CAIIBxAH\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sae=\"\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"KdQfFc#d5Qebf\" data-sfc-root=\"c\" jsuid=\"eweHjf_1e\" data-complete=\"true\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"tP2kf#s32ZS\" data-sfc-root=\"c\" jsuid=\"eweHjf_1f\" data-complete=\"true\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);\">Lok Sabha vs. Rajya Sabha (Central Level):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> Unlike the state council, the <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"tP2kf#s32ZS\" data-sfc-root=\"c\" jsuid=\"eweHjf_1g\" data-complete=\"true\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);\">Rajya Sabha<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> has <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"tP2kf#s32ZS\" data-sfc-root=\"c\" jsuid=\"eweHjf_1h\" data-complete=\"true\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);\">equal power<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> with the <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"tP2kf#s32ZS\" data-sfc-root=\"c\" jsuid=\"eweHjf_1i\" data-complete=\"true\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);\">Lok Sabha<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> on ordinary bills—disagreements require a <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"tP2kf#s32ZS\" data-sfc-root=\"c\" jsuid=\"eweHjf_1j\" data-complete=\"true\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);\">Joint Sitting<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> of both houses.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><span></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li class=\"Z1qcYe\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"oSLmPe#HokZ0d\" data-sfc-root=\"c\" jsuid=\"eweHjf_1p\" data-hveid=\"CAIIBxAK\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sae=\"\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"KdQfFc#d5Qebf\" data-sfc-root=\"c\" jsuid=\"eweHjf_1q\" data-complete=\"true\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"tP2kf#s32ZS\" data-sfc-root=\"c\" jsuid=\"eweHjf_1r\" data-complete=\"true\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);\">Council Members (MLCs):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> A mix of indirect representatives chosen by <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"tP2kf#s32ZS\" data-sfc-root=\"c\" jsuid=\"eweHjf_1s\" data-complete=\"true\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);\">MLAs (1/3)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>, <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"tP2kf#s32ZS\" data-sfc-root=\"c\" jsuid=\"eweHjf_1t\" data-complete=\"true\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);\">local bodies (1/3)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>, <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"tP2kf#s32ZS\" data-sfc-root=\"c\" jsuid=\"eweHjf_1u\" data-complete=\"true\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);\">graduates (1/12)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>, <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"tP2kf#s32ZS\" data-sfc-root=\"c\" jsuid=\"eweHjf_1v\" data-complete=\"true\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);\">teachers (1/12)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>, and <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"tP2kf#s32ZS\" data-sfc-root=\"c\" jsuid=\"eweHjf_1w\" data-complete=\"true\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);\">Governor nominees (1/6)<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong>.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><span></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><li class=\"Z1qcYe\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"oSLmPe#HokZ0d\" data-sfc-root=\"c\" jsuid=\"eweHjf_22\" data-hveid=\"CAIIBxAN\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sae=\"\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"KdQfFc#d5Qebf\" data-sfc-root=\"c\" jsuid=\"eweHjf_23\" data-complete=\"true\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"tP2kf#s32ZS\" data-sfc-root=\"c\" jsuid=\"eweHjf_24\" data-complete=\"true\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);\">\"Federal Weapon\" (Articles 200 &amp; 201):<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> The Governor's power to send a state bill to the <strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"tP2kf#s32ZS\" data-sfc-root=\"c\" jsuid=\"eweHjf_25\" data-complete=\"true\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);\">President<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> instead of signing it. Because power is <em class=\"zhvwWe\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"\" jscontroller=\"LFsGHb#ycPkjf\" data-sfc-root=\"c\" jsuid=\"eweHjf_26\" data-complete=\"true\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(22, 23, 26);\">divided<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></em> (federal) between the Centre and States, this lets the Central Government step in and permanently block or stall a state law.<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><span></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></ul><div class=\"yhAwj\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" jsaction=\"rcuQ6b:&amp;eweHjf_2c|npT2md\" jscontroller=\"UTzWVc#U8DOt\" data-sfc-root=\"c\" jsuid=\"eweHjf_2c\" data-complete=\"true\" data-processed=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px;